  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Fei He mountain, during an Immortal Crane Sect Gu Immortal meeting, a fourth elder asks for her input before voting on funds to heal the captured ancient desolate beast spirit rhino. The sect captured that beast to use its blood for a more secretive information path Gu worm, and she answers that progress is slow because the rhino’s body is full of poisonous blood.",
      "chapters": [
        697
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_fei_he_mountain",
        "fac_immortal_crane_sect",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When the meeting turns to Feng Jiu Ge lending a raised one’s own way Immortal Gu, she looks at He Feng Yang and notes that with one’s own way Gu they will not be suppressed by the blessed land and can use mortal Gu freely.",
      "chapters": [
        698
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hu-immortal-strike-support",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jiu_ge",
        "gu_ones_own_way_immortal_gu",
        "char_he_feng_yang",
        "sys_mortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Before the strike, He Feng Yang borrows her rank six information path Immortal Gu Mutual Sense; Lord Tiger Demon later activates that Gu over Fang Zheng’s blood pool so the blood sense link can lock onto Fang Yuan.",
      "chapters": [
        699
      ],
